ut she's still a klutz. She puts her all into everything."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a very deep sleeper, and usually wakes up late and still sleepy. She's very hard to wake up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Watching TV, variety shows, afternoon naps"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Being lonely"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c73629"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23c530cea9938beb9bd7d35fe083a05c9e90fa3a2355dababa19db38abe091e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/835f634f5cc14abf7f8858c7fe58bc03365351aab60658422e0a8c3050e77da2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"文月 かな","creatorId":"vndb:s54","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s54","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s54","name":"文月 かな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6423","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c73630","characterName":"菜々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c73630"},"originalCharacterName":"菜々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The serious type. Therefore, sometimes she can seem a little snarky or cold-hearted. She's also more or less an idealist, and sometimes can get a little spacey."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Is very cute when she's sleepy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Stuffed animals, jam, tea, cucumbers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Coffee (too bitter), hot milk (thinks it's smelly)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c73630"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b84dfc5fe0102e927de778815ff460db29882a43fab9d0793495594957de3af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/53320569f18d4b384af35082415e75c6b646d001cf9ffafe69506a02fa1e14d0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"芹園 みや","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"榊木春乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6426","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c73631","characterName":"流々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c73631"},"originalCharacterName":"流々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very firm...seeming person, but really a ditz. A natural mediator. Tends to drop her wallet a lot, no matter how much she tries to hold onto it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A warm-hearted onee-san. Likes to take care of others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Canned mandarin oranges, cats, baths, women's magazines (Like Josei S●ven or Josei ●mi...)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Coins with holes in them (5 yen and 50 yen coins), fizzy drinks (she can't drink them), complex electrical appliances (doesn't understand them, they don't seem to like her either)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c73631"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/3909572c1e8378270ee52a13f89b6a6c4625df9320c8ff34c715cdb08e01c2f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f4ca1552cbb98e70710b781e0e507d510fea7e218c8ad9d4779becd07f3789e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"秋月 まい","creatorId":"vndb:s657","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s657","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s657","name":"谷井 あすか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6428","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c73632","characterName":"心々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c73632"},"originalCharacterName":"心々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very eccentric girl. Seems lost in her own little world. Seems like she's hiding secrets, but she's not."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Quiet. Polite. Just a little strange. Pretty ditzy too. If she's quiet for too long, she's probably asleep. She sleeps a lot, and sometimes it's hard to tell if she's awake."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Katsuobushi, miso soup"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Fans (they make her dizzy), tying bows (hers always end up warped), vacuum cleaners (she hates the sound)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c73632"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/3321b80e734500ab02fe3920ccbc503aa31b05f887e1baf3febdae87e12ab62a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b65321625561b1d75740308eb738e1b68cd27da4c19bcdc30f5d2297c40c1a1f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"茶谷 やすら","creatorId":"vndb:s266","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s266","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s266","name":"永田 佳代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6425","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c73633","characterName":"音々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c73633"},"originalCharacterName":"音々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","sta